{"nodes": [{"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_methods_accessors_and_spread_method_shorthand", "label": "Object method shorthand", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/object-literals/methods-accessors-and-spread.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not equivalent to prop: function(){}. Methods cannot be constructors (TypeError) and only methods have super via a home object. Arrows in literals capture enclosing this, not the object."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_methods_accessors_and_spread_object_spread", "label": "Object spread", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/object-literals/methods-accessors-and-spread.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Copies own enumerable string and symbol keys shallowly, excluding the prototype. Spreading a class instance drops methods. Later spreads win; a spread after an explicit key silently overwrites it."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_methods_accessors_and_spread_object_assign", "label": "Object.assign", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/object-literals/methods-accessors-and-spread.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Mutates the target and triggers its setters (MDN warning). Keeps the target prototype. Not interchangeable with { ...a, ...b }."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_methods_accessors_and_spread_accessors", "label": "Getter and setter properties", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/object-literals/methods-accessors-and-spread.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Look like data properties but run functions. Spread and Object.assign invoke getters and store a snapshot. Preserve with getOwnPropertyDescriptors."}, {"id": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_methods_accessors_and_spread_duplicate_keys", "label": "Duplicate object keys last wins", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/object-literals/methods-accessors-and-spread.html", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "After ES2015 duplicates are legal even in strict mode because computed keys cannot be checked at parse time. Only private class elements must stay unique."}], "edges": [{"source": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_methods_accessors_and_spread_object_spread", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_methods_accessors_and_spread_object_assign", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes/object-literals/methods-accessors-and-spread.html", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_object_literals_methods_accessors_and_spread_object_spread", "target": "build_css_p2_docs_javascript_pages_phase_4_objects_and_classes_shallow_vs_deep_copy_what_shallow_means_shallow_copy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "build-css-p2/docs/javascript/pages/phase-4-objects-and-classes